# Bit-count functions (IEEE 1800 §20.9): lowered to sums of bits.

== onehot_antecedent
property: $onehot(v) |-> b
clause: 16.12.7 20.9
class: normative
signals: v:4 b
sample : 0 1 2 3 4
v      : 0 1 3 8 15
b      : . . . . .
fail   : . 1 . 1 .

== onehot0_consequent
property: a |-> $onehot0(v)
clause: 16.12.7 20.9
class: normative
signals: a v:4
sample : 0 1 2 3
a      : 1 1 1 1
v      : 0 4 6 2
fail   : . . 1 .
pass   : 1 1 . 1

== countones_compare
property: a |-> $countones(v) == 2
clause: 16.12.7 20.9
class: normative
signals: a v:4
sample : 0 1 2 3
a      : 1 1 1 1
v      : 3 5 7 0
fail   : . . 1 1
pass   : 1 1 . .
